   "headingEn": "Plural forgets gender entirely",
   "en": "Here is a gift: in the plural, you stop caring about gender. Masculine, feminine, neuter — in the plural they ALL take one ending, -ые. новые книги, новые дома, новые окна. One tail covers everything once there is more than one."
