   "noteEn": "Watch out: neuter это looks identical to the frozen 'this is' это. Tell them apart by context. If it opens a statement naming something ('Это окно' = 'This is a window'), it is the frozen pointer. If it hugs a neuter noun that is then described ('это окно открыто' = 'this window is open'), it is the agreeing form."
