   "kind": "tryit",
   "headingEn": "Try it: mom or dad?",
   "promptEn": "You hear MA-ma with the beat up front. Is that mom or dad?",
   "answerRu": "мама",
   "translit": "MA-ma",
   "answerNote": "Mom. Front beat = мама (mom). Back beat = папа (dad). The position of the strong beat alone tells them apart."
