   "ru": "До свидания!",
   "translit": "da svi-DA-ni-ya",
   "en": "'Goodbye' is really two words: до ('until') + свидания ('the meeting'). You're literally saying 'until we meet'.",
   "noteEn": "So learning to spell свидания unlocks the whole polite farewell."
