   "headingEn": "One \"you\" or two?",
   "en": "English lost its separate polite \"you\" centuries ago. Russian kept the split — and choosing wrong sounds either too cold or too familiar.",
   "leftTitle": "ты (ty) — close",
   "rightTitle": "вы (vy) — distant/plural",
