   "headingEn": "Same word for adjective and adverb",
   "en": "Because it doesn't inflect, one form covers two English jobs. 'This film is more interesting' (adjective) and 'He runs faster' (adverb) both use the exact same -ее word. Russian doesn't split them the way English splits 'faster' the adjective from 'faster' the adverb."
