   "kind": "warning",
   "headingEn": "\"He has no friends\" — plural genitive",
   "en": "For \"He has no friends,\" the missing thing is plural: друзья → друзей. У него нет друзей. Absence still forces genitive; the plural just has its own endings you'll drill next.",
   "ru": "У него нет друзей.",
   "translit": "U nyego nyet druzyey.",
   "noteEn": "Singular or plural, нет never lets the noun stay in the plain form."
