   "headingEn": "Why a word meaning \"give\"?",
   "en": "давать literally means \"to give.\" Saying \"give, let's go\" is like the English \"come on, let's go\" — you're nudging the other person to hand over their yes. That warm, pushy feeling is why it sounds so natural and friendly.",
   "noteEn": "English does the same thing: \"give it a go,\" \"give me a hand.\""
