   "en": "должен started life as an adjective — think \"I am obligated\" — which is exactly why it takes gendered endings like other adjectives (должен / должна). надо is just an adverb-like particle, so it stays frozen. The grammar mirrors the meaning: an adjective describes a person, a particle describes a situation.",
