   "headingEn": "Preposition beats number",
   "ru": "о + двух студентах (не «о два студента»)",
   "en": "When a preposition governs the phrase, its case wins for EVERYTHING inside — the number and the noun both go into that case. Here о forces prepositional plural: двух студентах.",
   "noteEn": "The number rule is overridden, not deleted. It simply yields to a stronger governor."
