   "headingEn": "Why instrumental for интересоваться?",
   "en": "The instrumental case originally meant 'by means of / by contact with'. To be interested in something is, in the old logic, to be occupied BY it — your mind is in contact with it. интересоваться историей = literally 'busy oneself by-means-of history'. The case name is your memory hook.",
   "noteEn": "гордиться (be proud) and заниматься (do/study) share the same 'in contact with' logic — all instrumental."
