   "headingEn": "Why does с mean instrumental here but о mean prepositional?",
   "en": "Each Russian preposition is hard-wired to a case. с (\"together with\") always summons the instrumental — the case of accompaniment and tools. о (\"about\") always summons the prepositional — the case of topics. The preposition, not the sentence, decides. Memorize the pairing once and it's permanent.",
