   "ru": "По-моему, это правда.",
   "en": "You want to weigh in on a debate. Start with one word: по-моему — \"in my opinion.\" Drop it in front of any sentence and you've staked a claim. This lesson gives you the whole B1 toolkit: opening a view, backing it up, agreeing, and pushing back.",
