   "translit": "pa-MO-ye-mu, eta feyk. — a ya DUH-ma-yu, shto eta PRAV-da.",
   "en": "\"In my opinion, that's fake.\" — \"Well, I think it's true.\" This whole lesson is your ear catching four or five signal phrases in a stream of speech. Learn the signals and the rest falls into place.",
   "noteEn": "You don't need every word — you need the opener that tells you an opinion is coming."
