   "kind": "concept",
   "headingEn": "Openers flag an opinion",
   "en": "Russian marks an opinion with a short opener at the front of the sentence. Once you hear the opener, your brain knows: what follows is what this person believes, not a fact. Three openers cover almost everything you'll hear.",
   "ru": "я думаю, что... · по-моему · мне кажется, что...",
   "translit": "ya DUH-ma-yu shto · pa-MO-ye-mu · mnye KA-zhet-sa shto"
