   "headingEn": "Why по-моему is one word with a hyphen",
   "en": "По-моему is built from по + мой (\"my\"). Russian glues по- to possessives to mean \"in my/your way\" — the same pattern as по-русски (\"in Russian\") or по-твоему (\"in your opinion\"). Hearing по- at the start is a reliable opinion signal.",
   "ru": "по- + мой → по-моему",
