   "headingEn": "The spelling trap the exam loves",
   "en": "The prefixes без-/из-/раз-/воз- switch з → с before a voiceless consonant. So: разбить but расписание, возможный but восход, безопасный but бесполезный. Seeing с- glued before п/т/к/с is your clue you are looking at one of these prefixes — not a different word.",
