   "kind": "warning",
   "headingEn": "The case trap",
   "en": "Несмотря на is a PREPOSITION and always takes the accusative — never the genitive. So критика → критику, сложность → сложность (a feminine -ость noun looks unchanged in the accusative, but it IS accusative). Getting the case wrong is the classic B2 slip.",
   "ru": "несмотря на критику (acc.), не «несмотря на критики».",
