   "kind": "why",
   "headingEn": "Why alternate your connectors",
   "en": "Spoken Russian can lean on поэтому and но all day, but in an essay repetition reads as thin thinking. Rotating следовательно, таким образом, однако, and более того signals to an examiner that you can name each logical move precisely — exactly the control the TORFL B2 writing task rewards. Variety here is not style; it is evidence of reasoning."
