   "kind": "concept",
   "headingEn": "Listening: hold the gist, catch the turn",
   "en": "You hear a monologue or dialogue once or twice — no transcript, no rewind. Don't try to catch every word. Track the speaker's overall stance, and prick up your ears for 'turn' words that announce the key point is coming right now."
