   "headingEn": "Speaking: perform a function, don't just talk",
   "en": "Speaking prompts ask you to DO something with language: describe a situation, compare two options, give and defend an opinion, or react in a role-play — make a complaint, ask for advice, persuade. Read the prompt for the verb: «Сравните…» means compare-and-argue, not merely 'talk about'. Deliver the function they named."
