   "en": "A live gerund must share its subject with the main verb. But «Несмотря на трудности, проект был завершён в срок» is perfectly correct — even though the main clause is PASSIVE and «проект» is not 'doing' the despising. Because несмотря на is a frozen preposition, it heads a subjectless or passive clause without error.",
