   "headingEn": "Snow that lands on your head",
   "ru": "Это было как снег на голову.",
   "translit": "Eto bylo kak sneg na gólovu.",
   "en": "It came completely out of the blue. Literally: 'like snow on the head'.",
   "noteEn": "Imagine snow sliding off a roof straight onto you — no warning at all. That's the feeling this idiom carries."
