   "headingEn": "One vowel flips the meaning",
   "ru": "Не за что ≠ Ни за что",
   "translit": "Nye za chto ≠ Ni za chto",
   "en": "Не за что means 'you're welcome'. Ни за что means 'never / no way'. Reply to thanks with Ни за что and you've just told someone you'd never do it — the opposite of gracious.",
   "noteEn": "Не- softens ('nothing to thank for'); ни- negates absolutely ('for nothing on earth')."
