   "kind": "keyRule",
   "headingEn": "The load-bearing rule",
   "en": "A conversational formula and its reply are learned as a pair, exactly as fixed. The wording and the situation are both conventional — change either and it stops sounding native.",
   "ru": "Ни пуха ни пера! → К чёрту!",
   "translit": "Ni púkha ni perá! → K chórtu!",
