   "headingEn": "Signposts announce the topic",
   "en": "Some phrases don't argue anything — they just tell you what the paragraph is ABOUT. The most common is речь идёт о... (\"it concerns...\" / \"the topic is...\"). When you see it, the noun that follows is the subject of the whole passage. It's the author handing you the label."
