   "headingEn": "Explicit author signposts point at the thesis",
   "en": "When a sentence opens with следует подчеркнуть, что... (it should be emphasized that...) or необходимо отметить, что... (it must be noted that...), the author is literally pointing: the clause that follows IS the main idea. Don't skim past it — that's the thesis, gift-wrapped.",
