   "translit": "Pochtal'ón prinyós pis'mó.",
   "en": "Now flip it. Same three words, reversed. This one answers 'What did the postman bring?' — the postman is old news, and the NEW fact, the letter, moved to the end.",
   "noteEn": "Nothing about the grammar changed. Only the spotlight moved."
