   "headingEn": "The end position and the voice",
   "en": "This isn't only written grammar. Say a neutral Russian sentence aloud and your pitch peak — the intonation centre Russians call IK-1 — falls on the LAST stressed word. Word order and melody point at the same target: whatever ends the sentence is what you're really telling me.",
   "noteEn": "Your voice and your word order agree on where the news is."
