   "en": "-изм is a borrowed suffix (Greek/Latin -ismos), so words built with it look nearly identical across European languages: реализм, капитализм, патриотизм. When you meet an unknown -изм word, your English almost always already knows it.",
   "ru": "патриотизм ≈ patriotism",
   "translit": "patriotízm"
