   "kind": "mnemonic",
   "icon": "🧅",
   "ru": "не · зависим · ость",
   "en": "Picture peeling an onion from the outside in — outer skin -ость (a quality), next layer не- (not), then the core -зависим- (dependent).",
   "noteEn": "Every long abstraction is an onion: peel the suffix, then the prefixes, then bite the root."
