   "kind": "tip",
   "headingEn": "In short",
   "en": "Compounds join two roots with -о- (after hard) or -е- (after soft/sibilant) · Learn recurring elements: -ведение/-логия = 'study of', -воз = 'carrier' · -ость = a quality, -ство = a collective/state, -изм = a doctrine · Peel long abstractions from the outside in: suffix, then prefixes, then root."
