   "headingEn": "One argument, one paragraph",
   "en": "Each separate argument gets its own paragraph — its own абзац. A new абзац visually signals \"here is my next reason\", and examiners reward that clarity. Cramming two arguments into one block reads as disorganised thinking.",
   "ru": "Каждый аргумент — отдельный абзац.",
   "translit": "Kazhdyy argument — otdel'nyy abzats.",
   "noteEn": "Абзац literally means the indented start of a paragraph."
