   "en": "«Несмотря на» is a PREPOSITION — it grabs a noun. «Хотя» is a CONJUNCTION — it introduces a full clause with a finite verb. Everything else in the lesson hangs off this one distinction.",
   "noteEn": "Preposition → noun. Conjunction → whole sentence."
