   "translit": "Chto by ni sluchilos', ya ryadom.",
   "en": "Slot «бы» in and the verb goes to the PAST-tense form, giving a hypothetical, forward-looking sweep: \"whatever may happen…\", \"wherever he may live…\". The frame is wh-word + «бы» + … + «ни» + past verb.",
