   "translit": "Gde by on ni zhil, on vsyudu chuvstvoval sebya doma.",
   "en": "\"Wherever he lived, he felt at home everywhere.\" Read the frame: «где» sets the range, «бы» adds hypotheticality, «ни» stamps \"across all of it,\" and the verb «жил» sits in its past form. The «ни» is obligatory and, again, is NOT a negation.",
