   "kind": "example",
   "headingEn": "Watch two sentences weld together",
   "ru": "Реформа была принята в спешке. Эта поспешность и стала причиной её провала.",
   "en": "\"The reform was adopted in haste. This very haste became the cause of its failure.\" Read it twice. The end of sentence one — «в спешке» — reappears at the start of sentence two as «эта поспешность». That handoff is what makes the text feel welded, not stacked.",
   "noteEn": "You just met cohesion in action before we named a single rule."
