   "kind": "concept",
   "headingEn": "Reference chains: vary how you name a thing",
   "en": "Cohesion isn't just sprinkling in «однако» — connectives are one quarter of the machine, alongside reference chains, deliberate repetition, and parallel syntax. The first device: rather than repeat one noun, slide along a chain — full noun → pronoun → synonym → hyperonym. «автомобиль» → «он» → «машина» → «это транспортное средство».",
   "noteEn": "A hyperonym is just a broader umbrella word (vehicle > car). Each link points back to the same thing."
