   "headingEn": "«да» is a false friend here",
   "en": "Don't read this «да» as \"yes\" or \"and\". Mid-sentence, between two clauses, «да» is an adversative \"but\". «Хотел прийти, да не смог» = \"I wanted to come, but couldn't.\"",
   "ru": "Хотел прийти, да не смог.",
   "translit": "Khotél priytí, da ne smog.",
   "noteEn": "Context, not the word itself, tells you which «да» you're hearing."
