   "headingEn": "The lexical-overlap trap",
   "en": "This is the sneakiest one. The option quotes the text's exact words — so it FEELS right — but scrambles who did what to whom, or which idea depends on which. Matching vocabulary is not matching meaning. Verify the relationship between the words, not their presence.",
