   "en": "Pushkin pairs opposites — wave/stone, verse/prose, ice/flame — to show two irreconcilable friends. Yoking opposites this way is антитеза. The meaning of each word is literal; the CLASH between the paired words carries the sense.",
   "noteEn": "Antithesis needs a genuine opposition, not just two different nouns."
