   "kind": "why",
   "headingEn": "Why the same list feels different",
   "en": "Take a list and remove every «и»: the eye rushes through it, so бессоюзие reads as speed or exhaustion. Now flood it with «и»: each conjunction forces a tiny pause, so многосоюзие reads as accumulation, abundance, a piling-up you can't stop. Same items, opposite tempo — the joins set the pace.",
