   "headingEn": "The rhetorical question",
   "en": "«Что в имени тебе моём?» — 'What is my name to you?' — expects no reply. A риторический вопрос uses the shape of a question purely for expressive force: it states or laments while pretending to ask, pulling the reader into the speaker's feeling.",
