   "kind": "concept",
   "headingEn": "Анафора: repeat the opening",
   "en": "Анафора repeats the same word or phrase at the START of successive clauses. The repeated head becomes a drumbeat, and each new clause adds weight to the same idea: «Не верю, не вижу, не приемлю…».",
