   "headingEn": "The период — a suspended sentence",
   "en": "A период is a long, deliberately architected sentence that holds its main sense in suspension — piling up parallel or antithetical clauses — and releases the meaning only at a resounding close. The wait is the point: it builds pressure, then discharges it.",
   "noteEn": "Return to the opening example — that IS a период. The sense doesn't resolve until «вот чем...»."
