   "headingEn": "Inversion: marked word order for emphasis",
   "en": "Инверсия breaks neutral word order to throw weight onto a word. «Тяжела ты, шапка Мономаха» fronts the predicate «тяжела» ('heavy') before the subject — neutral would be «Шапка Мономаха тяжела». The dislocation isn't error; it's emphasis, the heaviness pressed to the very front of the line.",
