   "en": "Надлежит means 'it is incumbent / one is required to' — a cold, impersonal decree-word. Slip it in front of a chore and «надлежит незамедлительно приступить к мытью посуды» stops meaning 'we should wash up' and starts sounding like a government directive about dishes.",
