   "headingEn": "The self-contradicting sentence",
   "en": "Sometimes irony needs no fancy vocabulary — the facts betray themselves. «Совещание, посвящённое борьбе с волокитой, по техническим причинам перенесено в шестой раз» — 'The meeting devoted to fighting red tape has, for technical reasons, been postponed a sixth time.' A meeting against delays is itself endlessly delayed. The stock excuse «по техническим причинам» exposes the self-contradiction.",
