   "en": "Texted to you after a disastrous presentation: 'Well, you, as always, true to form.' It never says 'you failed.' «В своём репертуаре» names a fond, familiar pattern — this is you being you again. Read as affectionate-ironic ribbing: the tone teases without attacking.",
