   "en": "The clash of registers, not the word, carries the attitude · Up = mock-elevation, down = бато́с · Канцелярит and mock-heroic borrow a costume to deflate it · Deadpan keeps the tone flat while content stays absurd · Context tells contempt from affection · Never explain the joke."
