   "kind": "concept",
   "headingEn": "Now, the pharmacy",
   "ru": "У вас есть лекарство от кашля?",
   "translit": "U vas yest lekárstvo ot káshlya?",
   "en": "Appointment done, you head to the аптека (pharmacy). Ask what they have: \"Do you have cough medicine?\" У вас есть…? = \"Do you have…?\" (literally \"at you is there…?\")."
