   "promptEn": "The clerk rattled off your ticket number and you missed it. What do you say to hear it again?",
   "answerRu": "Повторите, пожалуйста.",
   "translit": "Povtorite, pozhaluysta.",
   "answerNote": "\"Repeat, please.\" You already have your first survival phrase working."
