   "ru": "Здравствуйте!",
   "translit": "Zdravstvuyte!",
   "en": "Picture stepping onto a river cruise. You catch the eye of the guide and say one warm word: «Здравствуйте!» It means hello, and it fits anyone — a waiter, a neighbor, a stranger you just met. Say it, and you have greeted politely."
