   "headingEn": "The reply that comes back",
   "ru": "Пожалуйста.",
   "translit": "Pozhaluysta.",
   "en": "Say «спасибо» to a Russian and you'll almost always hear one word float back: «пожалуйста» — 'you're welcome.' It's the natural echo to any thanks, warm and automatic."
